  "body": "@wisniewskit just added an alias for `-webkit-clip-path` to `clip-path` for Firefox\r\nsee https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1800969\r\n\r\nIt might be worth considering adding it to the spec \r\nhttps://compat.spec.whatwg.org/#css-simple-aliases\r\n\r\nThe CSS spec doesn't mention any alias so far\r\nhttps://drafts.fxtf.org/css-masking/#the-clip-path\r\n\r\n\r\n",
